ust 2027Based at Western’s Parramatta South campus, with flexible working arrangementsSalary: HEW Level 7 $108,659 – $117,202 per annum, plus 17% Super and L Reference 8be7fd5c-8b3c-4b8c-8cc7-e5afa74ad1d4 Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Clinical Trials Manager Salary Location Campbelltown, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, 2 Years Fixed-Term position at HEW Level 8.Campbelltown campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $120,754 – $134,051 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Lead the Faculty’s Reference e79659b3-440d-431b-a92f-f1587fe778fc Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Apply"
